    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy, in partnership with Meeko Construction, proudly present Arda, Oberon - an exclusive new boutique development of premium homes situated on Main Street in Omeath, County Louth. \n\nArda Oberon is a bespoke collection of just six exceptional homes, thoughtfully designed to offer contemporary comfort, quality craftsmanship, and energy-efficient living. \n\nThis development also qualifies for the Help to Buy (HTB) scheme, making homeownership significantly more accessible for eligible first-time buyers.\n\nComprising four elegant semi-detached homes and two spacious detached residences, this exclusive development provides the perfect setting for first-time buyers, growing families, and those seeking a premium lifestyle in a picturesque coastal village.\n\nDespite its tranquil setting, Arda Oberon enjoys excellent transport links. Positioned along the main coastal route between Newry and Greenore, residents benefit from convenient access to the M1 Motorway, connecting Dublin and Belfast with ease. \n\nThe nearby towns of Dundalk and Newry offer a wealth of shopping, employment, educational, and leisure opportunities, as well as comprehensive rail and bus connections.\n\nJust minutes away is Greenore Port, one of the east coast's most strategically important deep-water ports, which highlights the area's rich maritime heritage and continued economic significance.\n\nA Home to Enjoy for Years to Come\n\nThe Chestnut is an outstanding three-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to an impressive 122 sq. m. of light-filled, thoughtfully arranged family living space. \n\nThe ground floor opens into a welcoming entrance hallway with a guest WC, leading to a spacious living room featuring premium herringbone flooring. \n\nTo the rear, a magnificent open-plan kitchen and dining area serves as the heart of the home, complete with integrated appliances and double doors opening onto a brick-paved patio and seeded garden. A highly practical, separate utility room keeps household tasks organised. \n\nUpstairs, the property features three generous bedrooms, including a luxurious master suite with a private en-suite, alongside a stylish, fully tiled family bathroom.\n\nWith its A-rated efficiency, high quality finished, and prime Main Street positioning, The Chestnut sets a new benchmark for modern coastal comfort.\n\nContact DNG Duffy to reserve your new home in this stunning new development today. \n\nDisclaimer: These particulars are issued for informational and marketing purposes only and do not constitute or form part of any offer, contract, representation, or warranty. All statements and materials are provided in good faith, but intending purchasers must satisfy themselves independently by inspection or otherwise as to their absolute accuracy. The developer reserves the right to alter or vary designs, layouts, materials, configurations, and specifications without prior notice.\n\nComputer-generated images, finishes, and artist's impressions are strictly illustrative; floor plans are not to scale and all dimensions are approximate. Neither the vendor, the selling agent, nor any person in their employment has the authority to make or give any representation, warranty, or guarantee regarding the properties. The development name is used solely for marketing purposes and may not be adopted as the official postal address or street name by the local authority."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.39m x 3.93m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 5.11m x 4.66m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.95m x 2.06m\n\n\nWC - 2.71m x 1.46m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.23m x 2.76m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.76m x 1.5m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.66m x 3.29m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.07m x 3.0m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.32m x 2.12m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Energy & Structure: High-quality block-built construction with an A-rated energy efficiency profile, extensive insulation, and a 10-year HomeBond structural guarantee.</li><li> Heating & Ventilation: Air-to-Water heat pump and hot water system providing underfloor heating on the ground floor, radiators upstairs, and a continuous fresh-air mechanical ventilation setup.</li><li> Windows & Security: Energy-efficient uPVC double-glazed windows and a premium, fully insulated composite front door with a secure multi-point locking system.</li><li> Included Floor Finishes: Premium flooring fitted as standard throughout, featuring herringbone flooring in the sitting room, tiling in the kitchen and bathrooms, laminate in all bedrooms, and carpets on the stairs and landing.</li><li> Internal Finishes: All walls and ceilings painted in a contemporary neutral tone, white panel doors, and molded skirtings and architraves with a hockey stick border.</li><li> Kitchen & Utility: Fitted contemporary kitchen with an integrated hob, oven, fridge-freezer, and dishwasher, alongside a matching utility room supplied with a washing machine and tumble dryer.</li><li> Bathrooms & Tiling: Sleek white sanitary ware with chrome fittings, featuring semi-pedestal units, a fully tiled family bathroom, and targeted wet-area tiling in the en-suite.</li><li> Electrical & Safety: Generous electrical layout with modern spotlights in key living spaces, high-speed fiber broadband pre-wiring, and hardwired smoke and heat detectors.</li><li> External Space: Private brick-paved patio leading to a fully seeded rear garden with rear access and designated off-street bay parking,</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A\n"
      },
